
Welcome to the YoRHa installer environment.

If you are not connected to the network, press Ctrl+C to drop to a shell,
then run `nmtui` to configure your connection. You can verify connectivity
with:

    ping -c3 archlinux.org

Once online, run `yorha-inst` to start the interactive installation again.

Documentation and updates:
    https://github.com/lcook/yorha

